      '{"answer_type":"short_text","body":{"value":"Only Student 2 is flagged (20 days overdue AND 3 books, both conditions true). Students 1 and 3 each fail at least one condition. This is a rule-based decision, not a learned one, useful for contrasting with AI from Module 1."}}'::jsonb,
